  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb236693f9dbe47498f4dd7ccccbfbf3, type: 3}
  m_Name: Q14
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::InterviewQuestionData
  question: "UI Toolkit vs UGUI (Canvas) \u2014 khi n\xE0o d\xF9ng c\xE1i n\xE0o?"
  choices:
  - text: "UGUI (Canvas) mature h\u01A1n, nhi\u1EC1u tutorial, d\u1EC5 d\xF9ng cho
      game UI v\u1EDBi world-space support. UI Toolkit (UI Builder) d\xF9ng USS/UXML
      gi\u1ED1ng web, t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n cho editor tools v\xE0 complex data-driven
      UI, performance t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n v\u1EDBi nhi\u1EC1u element. Hi\u1EC7n t\u1EA1i
      game th\u01B0\u01A1ng m\u1EA1i v\u1EABn ch\u1EE7 y\u1EBFu UGUI; UI Toolkit
      ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p project m\u1EDBi c\u1EA7n editor integration."
    score: 3
    feedbackHint: "So s\xE1nh ch\xEDnh x\xE1c, bi\u1EBFt UI Toolkit cho editor tools."
  - text: "UGUI d\u1EC5 d\xF9ng h\u01A1n v\xE0 nhi\u1EC1u t\xE0i li\u1EC7u. UI Toolkit
      m\u1EDBi h\u01A1n, gi\u1ED1ng CSS, ph\xF9 h\u1EE3p cho tool ph\u1EE9c t\u1EA1p."
    score: 2
    feedbackHint: "Hi\u1EC3u s\u1EF1 kh\xE1c nhau c\u01A1 b\u1EA3n."
  - text: "T\xF4i ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt UGUI v\u1EDBi Canvas. UI Toolkit t\xF4i ch\u01B0a
      d\xF9ng."
    score: 1
    feedbackHint: "Ch\u1EC9 bi\u1EBFt m\u1ED9t option...."
  category: Unity
